I am a Postdoctoral Researcher at Stanford CS.

Previously, I was a Student Researcher at [Google Research](https://research.google/), an ML Research Intern at [Apple Health AI](https://machinelearning.apple.com/work-with-us) and a data scientist and the second full-time employee at [HealthRhythms](https://www.healthrhythms.com). [?2004hroot@d6173059b1a6:/app/personal-site# 